{"shortDescription":"TORONTO, Sept. 18, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Prime Dividend Corp. (The \"Company\") declares its monthly distribution of $0.13267 for each Class A share and $0.05667 for each Preferred share. Distributions are payable October 9, 2026 to shareholders on record as at September 30, 2026.Under the distrib…","astDescription":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"p","children":["TORONTO, Sept. 18, 2026 ",{"type":"url","params":{"url":"https://www.globenewswire.com","linkText":"(GLOBE NEWSWIRE)"}}," -- Prime Dividend Corp. (The \"Company\") declares its monthly distribution of $0.13267 for each Class A share and $0.05667 for each Preferred share. Distributions are payable October 9, 2026 to shareholders on record as at September 30, 2026."]},{"type":"p","children":["Under the distribution policy announced on July 17, 2014, the monthly dividend payable on the Class A shares is determined by applying a 10.00% annualized rate on the volume weighted average market price (VWAP) of the Class A shares over the last 5 trading days of the preceding month. As a result, Class A shareholders of record on September 30, 2026 will receive a dividend of $0.13267 per share based on the VWAP of $15.92 payable on October 9, 2026. The yield will remain stable at 10.00% (based on the VWAP) under this distribution policy."]},{"type":"p","children":["Preferred shareholders will receive prime plus 2.35% with a minimum rate of 5.00% and a maximum rate."]},{"type":"p","children":["Since inception Class A shareholders have received a total of $15.86 per share and Preferred shareholders have received a total of $12.13 per share inclusive of this distribution, for a combined total of $27.99."]},{"type":"p","children":["The Company invests primarily in a portfolio of high yielding Canadian Companies as follows:"]},{"type":"table","children":[{"type":"table-body","children":[{"type":"table-row","children":[{"type":"table-data-cell","children":[{"type":"b","children":["Banks"]}]},{"type